    "notes": [
      "Annex transcribed from two official PDFs that agree: JDIH Kementerian Ketenagakerjaan 2026skb003.pdf and JDIH Kemenko Infrastruktur kepber/2026skb002.pdf. The 5 Januari row is printed with the scan errors lsra or Isra and Hijirah; it is stored as Isra Mikraj Nabi Muhammad S.A.W. 1448 Hijriah. The 26 Desember row is already printed as Hijriah.",
      "Diktum KEDUA states that 1 Ramadan 1448 Hijriah, Idul Fitri 1448 Hijriah, and Idul Adha 1448 Hijriah are established by Keputusan Menteri Agama. This file stores the Idul Fitri and Idul Adha dates printed in the annex. 1 Ramadan is not a national holiday in this decree.",
      "Diktum KEEMPAT states that cuti bersama reduces annual leave. Diktum KEENAM states that collective leave at private institutions is arranged by each leader. Diktum KETIGA tells vital public services to roster staff on these dates.",
      "The Sekretariat Negara announcement of this decree names the signatories as Menteri Agama Nasaruddin Umar, Menteri Ketenagakerjaan Yassierli, and Menteri PANRB Rini Widyantini, signed in Jakarta on 15 September 2026. The JDIH copies are scans; the readable signature marks match Nasaruddin Umar and Rini Widyantini.",
      "The decree cites Keputusan Presiden Nomor 8 Tahun 2024 tentang Hari-Hari Libur, and Peraturan Presiden Nomor 90 Tahun 2025 which amends Peraturan Presiden Nomor 140 Tahun 2024, among its considerations. Those citations are not holiday-date amendments. The dated annex is the operative list.",
      "No holiday-date amending decree was found when this dataset was compiled on 2026-11-09. amendments is empty for that reason."
    ]
  },
